# Converter arguments for qwen3.8-27b-heretic-ara (python -m tools.convert, one argument per line).
# The official groupwise-int recipe for Qwen3.8-27B (Q4/Q5 projections, Q8 vocabulary weights),
# which quantizes from the BF16 source alone. The NVFP4 recipe would also need an NVFP4/FP8
# compressed-tensors quantization of these exact weights, which no one publishes.
# Text, Vision and MTP, plus the indexed proposal head MTP drafting uses. No DFlash2: its companion
# is trained against the unmodified Qwen3.8-27B.
--model
/work/model
--recipe
qwen3_8_27b
--components
text,vision,mtp
--proposal
--resource
tokenizer.json=/work/frontend/tokenizer.json
--resource
tokenizer_config.json=/work/frontend/tokenizer_config.json
--resource
generation_config.json=/work/frontend/generation_config.json
--resource
chat_template.jinja=/ninfer/tools/chat_templates/qwen3_8.jinja
--resource
preprocessor_config.json=/work/frontend/preprocessor_config.json
--resource
video_preprocessor_config.json=/work/frontend/video_preprocessor_config.json
--name
qwen3.8-27b-heretic-ara
--device
cpu
--out
/out/qwen3_8_27b_heretic_ara.ninfer
